### Create ProductPOST http://localhost:8080/productsAuthorization: Bearer {{access_token}}Content-Type: application/json{  "name": "Macbook Pro",  "price": {{$random.float()}}}### GET product by ID#GET http://localhost:8080/products/{{$random.uuid}}GET http://localhost:8080/products/13f2e5ac-af39-42c0-adf0-18a27d18c842Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}### GET all productsGET http://localhost:8080/productsAuthorization: Bearer {{access_token}}### Update ProductPUT http://localhost:8080/products/13f2e5ac-af39-42c0-adf0-18a27d18c842 HTTP/1.1Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}{  "name": "Macbook",  "price": {{$random.float()}}}### Delete Product#DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/{{$random.uuid}}DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/13f2e5ac-af39-42c0-adf0-18a27d18c842Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}